[H2]Overview 4[\H2][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Founded: founding year.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]POP#: real population.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Corp: corporations present.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]XP: free unit experience.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]SXP: specialist free experience.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Specialist portraits: assigned specialists plus free specialists.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Angry icon: angry citizens.[PARAGRAPH:2][H2]Sorting and Colors[\H2][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Signed values sort numerically.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Positive helpful values are green, negative helpful values are red, and penalty modifiers invert that coloring.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Zero balance columns can show - for easier scanning, while zero modifier columns are blank.</English>
