 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5531+) **Beautified** and **expanded**, and add **support for text upscaling** for miscallenous **screens**: [CvDawnOfMan.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvDawnOfMan.py) ("The sun rises on the Year" greeting new game screen) is **expanded laterally and vertically** to **avoid scrolling**, add **icons** for buildings and units, add icon **chars for traits**; [CvTechSplashScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvTechSplashScreen.py) (when a new tech is discovered)  is moderately **expanded** to **avoid scrolling**, vertically center screen (was slightly excentered); [CvHallOfFameScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvHallOfFameScreen.py) is **maximized to full screen** with enlarged columns, and **new Leader, Civilization, Player Color, and Traits columns** with **icons** or **colors** or **chars** (based on Info Screen's Score tab: note that Civilization icon is approximative and will not work if Civilization name is not the base civ mod name (e.g. "The United States" -> "My American Custom Name Empire") (would add too much complexity in DLL for a working UI feature outside this edge case); note 2: trait info is indicative only (if traits in XML were different when the save file was made (e.g., expansive trait removed, leader trait allocation changed), this information will be lost)); [CvReplayScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvReplayScreen.py) is **maximized to full screen**; [CvDanQuayle.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvDanQuayle.py) ("you have displayed the leadership abilities" post-game screen) is **maximized to full screen** and has a **greatly expanded leader NIF** and **maximized vertically score table** to **avoid scrolling**. See [README.md (Miscallenous screens)](/README.md#miscallenous-screens)
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5517+) **Reorganized advisors**: **merged** the **espionage** screen into the **Foreign Advisor**, the **Economic Advisor's Finance Tab** into the **Domestic Advisor**, moved away the **Environment Tab** from the former **Economic Advisor** (now removed), the **Religion** Advisor and **Corporation** Advisor (so it is always visible and easier to access) into the new **Policy Advisor**; so they are now **tabs of these instead** (deleted the old now obsolete lone advisor .py files); **swap advisors**: **Victory screen** to F9 and **Info Screen** to F8 so the Info Screen is easier to split to F7 and F8 later on and so layout is **more logically organized** from internal to external advisors; **split advisors**: the **Foreign Advisor** is now split into **Foreign Trade Advisor (F4)** (TREATIES, BONUSES, TECHS, CITIES), and **Foreign Diplomacy Advisor (F3)** (RELATIONS, GLANCE, INFO, ESPIONAGE) as it **was crowded** to reduce the need for **tab navigation** and for **clearer thematic differentiation**, using a shell (i.e. almost empty file for **linking only**) [CvForeignDiplomacyAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvForeignDiplomacyAdvisor.py) file for the 2nd advisor.
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5524+) Rearrange Advisor **keyboard shortcuts** (in [CIV4ControlInfos.xml](/Assets/XML/Units/CIV4ControlInfos.xml) and DLL files like [CvEnums.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEnums.h), [CvEnums.h](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvEnums.h), [CvGameInterface.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameInterface.cpp), and [CyEnumsInterface.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CyEnumsInterface.cpp)) and adjust the **order of advisor buttons** in map view and **Sevopedia shortcuts** corresponding text to match the advisors changes.
